BUG-014: Replace stale doc refs docs/bug.md→docs/bugs.md, docs/feature.md→docs/features.md in main.yml (2 occurrences)
BUG-017: Replace hardcoded node-version: "20" with node-version-file: ".node-version" across 4 workflow files (11 occurrences)

Fixes the API build failure caused by wrangler requiring Node.js ≥22 when CI was pinned to Node 20.
---
 .github/workflows/iterate.yml       | 10 +++++-----
 .github/workflows/main.yml          |  4 ++--
 .github/workflows/on-pull.yml       |  2 +-
 .github/workflows/parallel.yml      |  8 ++++----
 .github/workflows/pr-gatekeeper.yml |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/iterate.yml b/.github/workflows/iterate.yml
index 76daead6..ccb20568 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/iterate.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/iterate.yml
@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@ jobs:
         continue-on-error: true
         uses: actions/setup-node@v6
         with:
-          node-version: "20"
+          node-version-file: ".node-version"
       - name: Install Dependencies
         continue-on-error: true
         run: npm ci
@@ -117,7 +117,7 @@ jobs:
